{"id":"e1843130733da3f0","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-continuous-apriori.md","title":"Continuous A Priori Semimeasure","display":"df-continuous-apriori — Continuous A Priori Semimeasure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-continuous-apriori","aliases":["43-df-continuous-apriori"],"display":"df-continuous-apriori — Continuous A Priori Semimeasure","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-continuous-semimeasure]]","[[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§10.1.2, maximal c.e. continuous semimeasure","source_printed_pages":"209","source_pdf_pages":"229","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-continuous-apriori"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-continuous-apriori</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-continuous-apriori — Continuous A Priori Semimeasure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dabe289b82d34117\" href=\"?note=dabe289b82d34117\" title=\"43-df-continuous-semimeasure\">43-df-continuous-semimeasure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc3ac987908461b8\" href=\"?note=cc3ac987908461b8\" title=\"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function\">43-df-lower-semicomputable-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.1.2, maximal c.e. continuous semimeasure"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"209"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"229"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^*=2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Sigma^*=2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}\">\\(\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dabe289b82d34117\" href=\"?note=dabe289b82d34117\" title=\"43-df-continuous-semimeasure\">43-df-continuous-semimeasure</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。固定函数列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(m_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((m_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_e:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,1]\">\\(m_e:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,1]\\)</span>，以及全函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathbb N\\times\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\">\\(q:\\mathbb N\\times\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}(m_e),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}(m_e),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;q(e,\\sigma,s)\\le q(e,\\sigma,s+1),\\qquad\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;m_e(\\sigma)=\\sup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}q(e,\\sigma,s),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;q(e,\\sigma,s)\\le q(e,\\sigma,s+1),\\qquad\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;m_e(\\sigma)=\\sup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}q(e,\\sigma,s),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall m:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,1]\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}(m)\\Rightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(m=m_e)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall m:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,1]\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}(m)\\Rightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(m=m_e)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；下式定义相对于这一固定枚举的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf M:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,1]\">\\(\\mathbf M:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,1]\\)</span>。非负级数按有限部分和的上确界求和。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf M(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\sum_{e=0}^{\\infty}2^{-(e+1)}m_e(\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf M(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\sum_{e=0}^{\\infty}2^{-(e+1)}m_e(\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有效枚举的全部条件现在在 Hypothesis 中给出：每项合格、统一递增有理逼近、覆盖全部有效连续半测度。各项取值至多 1，权重和为 1，所以混合在每个输入上有限且唯一。通用性保留在原有对应定理中。</p>\n<p>书目定位沿用附件的 §10.1.2，印刷页 209、PDF 页 229；本轮只作定义与内部依赖核查，未重新核对未附原书 PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-continuous-semimeasure","status":"resolved","id":"dabe289b82d34117","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-continuous-semimeasure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function","status":"resolved","id":"cc3ac987908461b8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-continuous-semimeasure","status":"resolved","id":"dabe289b82d34117","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma^*=2^{<\\omega}$；$\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}$ 见 [[43-df-continuous-semimeasure]]，$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]。固定函数列 $(m_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$，其中 $m_e:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,1]$，以及全函数 $q:\\mathbb N\\times\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}$，满足","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma^*=2^{<\\omega}$；$\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}$ 见 [[43-df-continuous-semimeasure]]，$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]。固定函数列 $(m_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$，其中 $m_e:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,1]$，以及全函数 $q:\\mathbb N\\times\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}$，满足","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma^*=2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"(m_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"m_e:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathbb N\\times\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}(m_e),","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;q(e,\\sigma,s)\\le q(e,\\sigma,s+1),\\qquad\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;m_e(\\sigma)=\\sup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}q(e,\\sigma,s),","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall m:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,1]\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}(m)\\Rightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(m=m_e)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf M:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf M(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\sum_{e=0}^{\\infty}2^{-(e+1)}m_e(\\sigma).","display":true}],"bytes":2202,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-continuous-apriori]] — Continuous A Priori Semimeasure"},{"id":"6d541e6684012418","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathbf M$ 见 [[43-df-continuous-apriori]]，$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。"},{"id":"04b222309e5248f2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf M$ 是 [[43-df-continuous-apriori]] 的枚举混合。"}],"outgoing":["f357216a7edb035a","dabe289b82d34117","cc3ac987908461b8"]}